            "default": "false.",
            "remarks": "This is not supported by all ACME servers like Let's Encrypt. If set to true when the ACME server does not support it it will create an error on the Order. Defaults to false.",
            "summary": "Enables requesting a Not After date on certificates that matches the duration of the certificate.",
